            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe is like crack to me. When I make these I cannot control myself. So good! I skip the walnuts and sub a combination of applesauce and avacado oil instead of vegetable oil. And, when making mini muffins, I use mini semi-sweet chocolate chips. They are done after about 13-15 minutes in the oven.",
