            },
            "reviewBody": "I live at 6000 feet, so I added 8 1/2 tbs to the liquid, added a bit more flour and used mostly oat flour, decreased the baking soda by half, decreased the sugar to 1/2 yellow sugar, increased oven heat a bit, and baked for 18 min. I replace the vegetable oil with a mix of butter, coco oil, and yogourt.",
