              "name": "Jessica Plummer O'Malley"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made as written with the exception of doubling the recipe and halved the cinnamon. Because I used one of the oopsy zucchini that was the size of loaf of french bread, I squeezed the grated zucchini in a kitchen towel to remove the excess water. These muffins have excellent texture and were delicious. Even my husband who isn't a muffin fan LOVED these. Making a second batch today with the remainder of the huge zuke.",
