            },
            "reviewBody": "These muffins are amazing!!! I made these changes: substituted flour with 1 cup Krusteaz gluten free flour and a 1/2 cup almond flour; substituted vegetable oil with 1/4 cup melted coconut oil and 1/4 apple sauce; substituted sugar with 1/2 cup swerve sugar substitute; substituted milk with almond milk . Increased cinnamon a bit. Love these so much!!!",
