              "name": "SneakyPop3617"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Quick, easy, and delicious; my kind of recipe! I did make a few minor adjustments, though. As others have said, this is a very forgiving recipe. I used a heaping cup of packed grated zucchini, subbed white flour for whole-wheat flour, subbed 1/4 cup of white sugar for brown sugar, and used 1/2 cup of chopped-up mixed nuts instead of just walnuts. The muffins tuned out great. They came out super moist and delicious. I will definitely be making them again.",
