            "reviewBody": "I printed this recipe off several years ago and just found it again. I had made notes of changes - 1/3 c applesauce and the rest oil, 1/2 c brown sugar, 1/4 white sugar, and I used apple cider vinegar because I didn't have lemon juice. They are wonderful!",
